    "change": "Integration 0059 unit A0 (user decisions 2026-10-04): the next RoboTwin default generation, robotwin_toolchain_b2_closed_noservo_v1 revision 20 plus the 0059 units. Ports M1, M3, M4, M5, V1 and V2; finish F1/F2 (policy_finish_outcomes_v2, policy_abort_infrastructure_round_v2); delivery D1, D2, D3a and E11BG6-004; the D02 reversal (grasp_plan_ik_reachability_annotation_v1 and the shared wait_ticks action, shared_hold_wait_action_v1); the M6 other-arm screen of the read-only reach check (robotwin_reach_check_inter_arm_screen_v1, endpoint only). place_plan, place_execute, place_resume and grasp_verify_retention are retired by undeclaration, as P04 retired them on the closed-skills surfaces, with the capabilities only they read; placement_refusal_measurements_v1 is moot without place_plan. No servo. The published-limits layers (N1/N2) come last and are generated from this surface's own text before them."
  },
